OL,3,GNEWSAHarshita Brella case to be raised
OL,4,Aby Attorney General
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Attorney General has vowed to raise
OL,7,Fthe case of Harshita Brella with other
OL,8,Fministers as the two-year anniversary
OL,9,Fof her death approaches.
OL,11,FThe body of the 24-year-old was found
OL,12,Fin a car in east London in November
OL,13,F2024, 100 miles (160km) from her home
OL,14,Fin Corby, Northamptonshire.
OL,16,FA hunt to locate her husband Pankaj
OL,17,FLamba, who is believed to have left the
OL,18,FUK for India, is ongoing after a murder
OL,19,Fcharge was authorised against him.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
